4:["$","main",null,{"className":"blog-page","children":[["$","$Le",null,{}],["$","article",null,{"className":"blog-article","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"shell blog-article-shell","children":[["$","$Lf",null,{"className":"blog-back-link","href":"/blog","children":[["$","$L10",null,{"ref":"$undefined","iconNode":[["path",{"d":"m12 19-7-7 7-7","key":"1l729n"}],["path",{"d":"M19 12H5","key":"x3x0zl"}]],"className":"lucide-arrow-left","size":16}]," All guides"]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"blog-tag","children":["Funding"," · ","One Window archive"]}],["$","h1",null,{"children":"Silver Scholarship Programs for Indian Students to Study Abroad – 2022"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"blog-article-intro","children":"Are you a student still undergoing graduation? Are you also someone who aspires to study abroad? Do you wish to have an admission opportunity to study in an Ivy League College before you get your Undergrad degree in your hands? Well, apparently some wild wishes do come true! You might not believe it, but there is a way of getting admission to Yale University for an MBA before you finish your bachelor’s. Let us tell you how."}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-article-body","children":[["$","section","Yale Silver Scholars Program",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Yale Silver Scholars Program"}],[["$","p","Yale Silver Scholars Program is a magical opportunity that paves way for a college senior to study for an MBA degree and begin a career in the booming industries of his choice.",{"children":"Yale Silver Scholars Program is a magical opportunity that paves way for a college senior to study for an MBA degree and begin a career in the booming industries of his choice."}]],["$","ul",null,{"children":[]}]]}],["$","section","Initiation and applicability",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Initiation and applicability"}],[["$","p","Silver Scholars is a 3-year early admission program open to college seniors all across the globe. It aims to create a holistic environment enabling candidates hailing from different educational backgrounds to share their skills, talent, and knowledge.",{"children":"Silver Scholars is a 3-year early admission program open to college seniors all across the globe. It aims to create a holistic environment enabling candidates hailing from different educational backgrounds to share their skills, talent, and knowledge."}],["$","p","The best thing about the program is that it is a contrast to the traditional style of Master’s Programs that rely on previous work experience for admitting students into the university as well as for providing job placements.",{"children":"The best thing about the program is that it is a contrast to the traditional style of Master’s Programs that rely on previous work experience for admitting students into the university as well as for providing job placements."}],["$","p","Although, the program admits only 5% of students in comparison to the rates of a traditional MBA course admission at Yale University.",{"children":"Although, the program admits only 5% of students in comparison to the rates of a traditional MBA course admission at Yale University."}],["$","p","Additionally, Yale Silver Scholars Program is the only one that provides an offer for an internship while you are still studying for a master’s degree.",{"children":"Additionally, Yale Silver Scholars Program is the only one that provides an offer for an internship while you are still studying for a master’s degree."}]],["$","ul",null,{"children":[]}]]}],["$","section","Skills and other requirements",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Skills and other requirements"}],[["$","p","The program does not require a yet-to-be undergraduate student to have any work experience but looks for other crucial skills such as:",{"children":"The program does not require a yet-to-be undergraduate student to have any work experience but looks for other crucial skills such as:"}],"$L11","$L12"],"$L13"]}],"$L14","$L15","$L16","$L17","$L18","$L19","$L1a","$L1b","$L1c","$L1d"]}],"$L1e"]}]}],"$L1f"]}]
